{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26762","headline":"罢武功县将入城 二 · 姚合","name":"罢武功县将入城 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青衫脱下便狂歌，种薤栽莎斸古坡。\n野客相逢添酒病，春山暂上着诗魔。\n亦知官罢贫还甚，且喜闲来睡得多。\n欲与九衢亲故别，明朝拄杖始经过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}